message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: Secure AI Agent Infrastructure
abstract: 'Reproducible research prototypes addressing one question: can an autonomous agent be trusted
  with a security decision, and would you know if it could not? Contains an agent verification harness
  that scores whether each claim in an LLM''s output is supported by the documents it retrieved, a per-class
  smart-contract vulnerability benchmark with audited negative controls, and an LLM audit agent. Results
  files record measured runs against SHA-256-pinned sources; metrics that the evidence does not support
  are withheld with a machine-readable reason rather than reported.'
